# SOC 910 project notes

This folder is the reading/presentation material for SOC 910 (Fall 2026).
It's a git repo pushed to `https://github.com/gabbydobbs/soc-910-coursework`
(private).

## Layout

- `my downloaded articles/` — source PDFs as downloaded
- `reading articles for seminar/` — the same papers plus Markdown
  conversions, named per the citation-filename skill
- `presentations/` — slide decks and exports for this course
- `SESSION_LOG.md` — running log of work sessions, updated by `/wrapup`

## Conventions

- Downloaded papers get renamed and (if ingested) converted following the
  `citation-filename` and `pdf-to-markdown` skills in `~/.claude/skills/`.
- End a work session with `/wrapup` to log progress, commit, and push.
- Global preferences, hard exclusions (Apple Notes, the Thesis folder,
  interview-data files), and writing/slide style notes live in the
  user-level `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md` — this file only covers what's specific
  to this folder.

## Kept out of git

Nothing sensitive lives in this folder by design — participant/interview
data for this user's thesis lives entirely outside it (see the exclusions
in `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`), so this project folder has no data-sensitivity
carve-outs of its own beyond the standard `.gitignore` (OS junk files,
Word lock files).
